      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "CRACKERJACK SEAN (2) has never missed the money at this C&D. Latest effort finished 2nd over 390m at Warrnambool beaten 2.25 lengths (22.63) behind Paw Archie in a Bottom Up - Maiden on November 16. Looks well placed here and rates a key player. Expected to be in the finish. COLD INTENT (8) showed little early speed at her last couple, the latest finishing seventh (23.70) in a Maiden at Geelong. Has ability and a bold showing is expected. MURDOCH (4) has his first outing without a trial but profiles nicely for this. Worth watching for a betting move. MAYGLASS (5) is a newcomer from the Deb Carr kennel. No favours with the draw and will need to begin well. Profiles nicely and can feature in the finish.",
